<td></td>

<td></td>

<td>This species occurs in global temperate and boreal oceans. According to Froese and Pauly (2020), it ranges from White Bay and Notre Dame Bay Newfoundland, to the Gulf of St. Lawrence, on the Scotian Shelf, along the Nova Scotia coastline, in the Bay of Fundy and south to North Carolina, straying to Florida.</td>

