<td>
</td>

<td></td>

<td></td>

<td>The Rocky Mountain Sculpin-Westslope Population occurs in the lower 28 km of the Flathead River in British Columbia, Canada, but is also found in intermountain Montana in the North and Middle forks of the Flathead River, and in the Whitefish River (a Flathead River tributary in Montana) (COSEWIC 2010).</td>

