<i>Margariscus margarita</i></td>

<td>Pearl Dace</td>

<td>
  </td>

<td>Bailey, R. M., W. C. Latta, and G. R. Smith. 2004. An atlas of Michigan fishes with keys and illustrations for their identification. University of Michigan Museum of Zoology Miscellaneous Publications No. 192. iv + 215 pp.</td>
