    <td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>
    </td>

<td>
    Habitat includes brackish water of estuaries, lagoons, coastal shallows, and bays, and fresh water in lowland and piedmont rivers; also lakes or inshore coastal waters; some remain in fresh water throughout their lives. Spawning occurs in freshwater streams in rapids, in clear water, over stone-gravel bottoms, or along lake shores. </td>

    <td>
      </td>

<td>
 </td>

<td></td>

