<td>Range includes the Pacific and Arctic seas off Russia, Alaska, and western Canada (Mecklenburg et al. 2011). North Pacific and Arctic: Wonsan, North Korea and the Sea of Okhotsk to Barkley Sound, British Columbia, north to the Bering Sea and the Arctic; estuaries and coastal waters of European and Siberian shores of Arctic Ocean from White Sea to Chukota in eastern Siberia (from FishBase).</td>

