<td></td>

<td></td>

<td>This species occurs in the Columbia River basin of the Pacific Northwest, in British Columbia (Canada), Washington, Oregon, and Idaho (USA). It is found in the Fraser River and tributaries to the Columbia River and Snake River below Shoshone Falls: Willamette, Boise, John Day, Yakima, Okanagan, Palouse, Owyhee, Salmon Falls, and (possibly) Salmon rivers (Smith et al. 2013).</td>

